flowchart TD
  A[Candidate predictions] --> B{Hard safety and feasibility constraints satisfied?}
  B -- No --> X[Exclude or request further evidence]
  B -- Yes --> C[Evaluate activity, stability, uncertainty and evidence]
  C --> D{What is experiment goal?}
  D -- Exploit evidence --> E[Prioritize well-supported candidates]
  D -- Learn / explore --> F[Prioritize informative uncertain candidates]
  E --> G[Scientist review]
  F --> G
  G --> H[Controlled measurement / update data]
